      correct:'D',
      expCorrect:'The figure of 148 arrests arrives already familiar. The underlined sentence gives the period meaning of the word that produced it, and everything after — the forty-one sheets, the thirty refusals, the closing reversal — depends on that meaning. Its job is to supply the definition that changes what the number counts.',
